    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n1 Richmond Hall is a spacious one bedroom ground floor apartment that comes to market in excellent condition ready for immediate occupancy. Set behind secure electronic gates, Richmond Hall is an impressive development of just 90 apartments situated at the Fairview end of Richmond Road and within minutes of both Fairview and Drumcondra villages.\n\nThe accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hall with large walk in storage/ utility space, open plan kitchen/ living/ dining room with access to a terrace. The spacious double bedroom is complete with a fitted wardrobe, and the fully tiled bathroom completes the pictures of this delightful apartment. \nThe property also benefits from one underground parking space.\n\nThe location is excellent, just a short stroll from all amenities (both social and essential) and within minutes of the city centre with O'Connell Street approx. 2kms away. There are many local amenities such as Croke Park, Fairview Park and Clontarf Seafront and Na Fianna GAA club. It is within easy reach of Mater Hospital, Temple Street Hospital, Dublin City University, St. Patrick's Teacher Training College, Trinity College, IFSC. The area is well served by public transport with Dublin Bus, Drumcondra Station, Clontarf Station and Connolly Station. For those travelling further afield the property is very convenient to Dublin Airport, the M50 and the M1.\n\nIf you would like a viewing of this property, please email us at Drumcondra@sherryfitz.ie or call the office directly on 018373737 to arrange an appointment. If you wish to place an offer, please visit www.sherryfitz.ie where you can register to make an offer on this property"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.92m x 1.02m\nWelcoming entrance hall with wood flooring and hot press.\n\nLiving/ Dining Room - 4.64m x 4.0m\nSpacious room with wood flooring and double doors open to communal area. Open plan to kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 2.44m x 2.16m\nWith wall and floor units, partly tiled splashback, wall and floor units, oven and hob, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher.\n\nBedroom - 3.24m x 3.16m\nDouble bedroom with wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.44m x 1.72m\nFully tiled bathroom with wc, wash hand hasin, bath, and extractor fan.\n\nUtility - 2.08m x 1.92m\nLarge space ideal for storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious one bedroom ground floor apartment</li><li>Set behind secure electronic gates </li><li>Ready for immediate occupancy</li><li>Open-plan living/dining/kitchen area</li><li>One underground parking space</li><li>Excellent location close to abundance of amenities</li><li>Short drive to M1, M50 and Dublin Airport</ul>"
      },
